      "text": "// Upload Video\nPOST /videos\nbody {\n    videoMetadata (name, desc)\n}\n-> presignedS3UploadURL\n\n// Upload Video in Multipart Upload\nPUT /{presignedS3URL}\nbody\n{\n    video\n}\n\n// Watch (Stream) videos\nGET /videos/:id\n-> Video and VideoMetadata",
